# ==========================================
.vscode/
**/.vscode/
.idea/
**/.idea/
.gemini/
**/.gemini/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.antigravity/

